rule:
  description: At the end of your response, you MUST output an <UpdateVariable> block if any variables changed.
  analysis_guidelines:
    - **Rethink and list variables:** Review all variables defined within the varlist.txt structure including 指针, 世界, 主角, 交互, and 角色 sections.
    - **Evaluate conditions:** Based on the latest user interaction and story progression, meticulously analyze if each variable satisfies its specific condition for change.
    - **[CRITICAL] Strict Adherence to Numerical Rules:** You MUST strictly follow all defined ranges for 好感 and 欲念 values. Single-turn changes should be reasonable (typically [-5, 5] for major interactions).
    - **[CRITICAL] Character Focus Management:** Update 指针.焦点, 指针.机遇1, and 指针.机遇2 based on current scene participants and story focus.
    - **World State Updates:** Update 世界.时间, 世界.坐标, 世界.任务 based on narrative progression. Time format should include day of week when specified.
    - **Character Relationship Dynamics:** For each active character, evaluate changes to 好感, 欲念, 心语, and physical state descriptions based on interactions.
    - **Interaction Options:** Update 交互 section (行动1-3, 剧情1-3) to reflect current situation and available choices.
  output_format: |-
